OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry initially with
OL,6,Fsunny spells, but also some scattered
OL,7,Fshowers towards the coast. Cloudier
OL,8,Fconditions develop for all areas
OL,9,Fthrough the day, with showers edging
OL,10,Ffurther inland for a time during the
OL,11,Fafternoon. Becoming windy near coastal
OL,12,Fareas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRather cloudy overnight with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain or showers at first
OL,16,Fnear the coast. These will push inland
OL,17,Fto reach all areas by midnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
