OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRather cloudy with spells of
OL,6,Flight rain or drizzle, especially
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Likely becoming
OL,8,Fdrier through the afternoon, but
OL,9,Ffurther rain overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOften
OL,12,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain on
OL,13,FTuesday and Wednesday, but also some
OL,14,Fdrier periods, especially on Thursday.
OL,15,FWindy near the coast. Temperatures
OL,16,Fgenerally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
